# Physician addendum — visible to assistant after finish

The physician addendum is an **optional** draft in `physicianAddendum`. There is no submit button.

The assistant must **not** see addendum content until the visit is finished and the addendum has content.

## State

- `physicianAddendum` — physician draft text
- `physicianAddendumCommitted` — set `true` on `FINISH_VISIT` when addendum text is non-empty

Editing the addendum clears `physicianAddendumCommitted` until the visit is finished again.

## UI

- **Physician:** optional labeled textarea; edits dispatch `UPDATE_PHYSICIAN_ADDENDUM`
- **Assistant:** read-only addendum only when `physicianAddendumCommitted && physicianAddendum.trim()`

See `VisitPanel.tsx`.
